\q2 for, “Who is hearing?”
\q1 \v 8 But you, Yahweh, laugh at them.
\q2 You mock all of the nations.
\q1 \v 9 Let me wait for you, his strength,
\q2 for God {is} my stronghold.
\q1 \v 10 The God of my covenant faithfulness will meet me.
\q2 God will make me look upon my enemies.
\q1 \v 11 Do not slay them, lest my people forget.
\q2 Scatter them by your power and bring them down, Lord, our shield.
\q1 \v 12 {For} the sin of their mouth, the word of their lips,
\q2 may they be taken in their pride,
