\q2 I divide Shechem and measure out the Valley of Succoth.
\q1 \v 7 To me {is} Gilead, and to me {is} Manasseh.
\q2 And Ephraim {is} the protection of my head; Judah, my scepter.
\q1 \v 8 Moab is the tub of my washing.
